OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FGenerally
OL,6,Fcloudy but dry overnight, with a brisk
OL,7,Feasterly wind near the coast. Becoming
OL,8,Fcold in rural areas, with some patchy
OL,9,Ffrost possible by dawn.
OL,10,
OL,11,CThursday:FA partly cloudy start to the
OL,12,Fday, becoming sunny and remaining dry
OL,13,Fduring the afternoon. Turning
OL,14,Fparticularly cold and frosty
OL,15,Fovernight, compared to previous nights.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
